  m_text: "Fsh is a 2D fishing game inspired by the United Nations Survival Development
    Goal #14 - Life Below Water. We made this game to raise awareness about the marine
    ecosystem and what we can do to reduce pollution. \n\nThe goals of the game are:\n-
    Try to protect marine life by clearing garbage\n- Clear enough garbage before
    the time runs out\n- Avoid hitting fish with your hook!\n\nWe hope you enjoy
    playing Fsh!\n"
